# @file Oguri Cap - Love
# @author 雞雞
# @author Katze (translator)
49:
  title: Yearning
  lines:
    - Oguri Cap stood on the training field at sunset, watching other %UMA%, seniors and juniors, training hard.
    - %SEX% saw those %UMA% talking happily with their trainers, and not one of them looked at a trainer with the same impure eyes.
    - %THEY% looked steady and honest, bound to their trainers on a thorny road toward a dream.
    -
    - But Oguri Cap couldn't look at %YOU% that way anymore.
    - At some point, lust had entered those eyes. Hunger for %YOU%.
    -
    - The Grey Cinderella that had eyes only for racing was already dead.
    -
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: Oguri Cap
        - 「Maybe I'm a terrible person.」
    - %SEX% thought that, with a shake of the head.
    -
    - acc: 1
      key: update
      content: 「Then I'll just keep sinking...」（Upgrade Relationship）
      lines:
        - divider: true
        - Late at night.
        - color: %COLOR%
          content:
            - fontWeight: bold
              content: Oguri Cap
            - 「%YOURNAME%... %YOURNAME%...!」
        -
        - Oguri Cap whispered %YOU%'s name and rubbed that crotch with a desperate heat, coming so hard %SEX% couldn't keep those eyes from rolling back.
        -
        - color: %COLOR%
          content:
            - fontWeight: bold
              content: Oguri Cap
            - 「Haah... haah...」
        - color: %COLOR%
          content:
            - fontWeight: bold
              content: Oguri Cap
            - 「I'm the worst...」
    - acc: 2
      content: 「I can't go on like this...」（Not Yet）

74-1:
  title: Infatuation
  lines:
    - Hunger. Craving. Want.
    - Romance. Love. Lust.
    -
    - Once a thought like that starts, it doesn't leave.
    - Push it aside for a while, and it comes right back.
    -
    - I want %YOU%...
    - I want to devour %YOU%...
    - I want to make %YOURSEX% mine...!
    -
    - Oguri Cap's conscience and desire were at war. The devil of gluttony wouldn't stop tempting that once-innocent soul, pulling Oguri down into lust one step at a time.
    -
    - acc: 1
      key: update
      content: 「I'm going to... eat you...!」（Ready to Confess）
    - acc: 2
      content: 「Ngh...! Stop it...!」（Not Yet）

74-2:
  title: Confession
  lines:
    - Oguri Cap almost never asked %YOU% to come behind the school building. When %YOU% arrived, %SEX% was leaning on the wall, eyes closed, looking like someone taking a rest.
    - %YOU% noticed Oguri Cap's breathing was a little fast, impatient almost. Had something urgent happened? %YOU% couldn't help worrying.
    -
    - —Right then, %SEX% spotted %YOU% and walked straight over.
    -
    - Wham!
    -
    - Arms locked around %YOU% and shoved %YOU% into the wall. The suddenness sent %YOU%'s heart hammering.
    - There was a bit of fear in it, but trust in Oguri kept %YOU% from putting up much of a fight.
    -
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: Oguri Cap
        - 「Sorry, Trainer... No. %YOURNAME%.」
    -
    - Oguri was mid-sentence when the title dropped and the given name came out instead. That caught %YOU% off guard.
    - Oguri was supposed to be a good kid who respected a trainer... right?
    -
    - %YOU% couldn't help thinking it.
    -
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: Oguri Cap
        - 「I want to eat you.」
    -
    - acc: 1
      content: '「...Huh?」'
    -
    - The line was so wild it knocked every thought out of %YOU%'s head. Only one sound made it out.
    -
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: Oguri Cap
        - 「You don't get it? I mean I want %YOU% to belong to me.」
    -
    - Oguri Cap never talked around a point, and that made the aggression coming off %SEX% even harder to face.
    -
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: Oguri Cap
        - 「...Still don't get it? Then... don't move.」
    -
    - %SEX% closed in fast, close enough that their lips were about to meet—
    -
    - acc: 1
      key: update
      content: Give In（Upgrade Relationship）
      lines:
        - The look on that flushed face had already gone mad. Trust, or fear—%YOU% gave in to Oguri Cap without thinking. The Monster forced %YOU%'s mouth open, and %SEX% got in with no trouble. %YOU% hadn't fought at all.
        -
        - It was a lousy kiss. Oguri Cap wasn't trying to be sweet. %SEX% was just savoring %YOU%'s mouth—spit, tongue, all of it.
        -
        - After a while %SEX% finally let go, panting, joy on that face—then it snapped into terror.
        -
        - color: %COLOR%
          content:
            - fontWeight: bold
              content: Oguri Cap
            - 「What did I...」
        -
        - acc: 1
          content: 「Oguri... why would you do that?」
        -
        - color: %COLOR%
          content:
            - fontWeight: bold
              content: Oguri Cap
            - 「I... I don't know. I'm sorry... I'm sorry...」
        -
        - %YOU% and Oguri Cap stared at each other without a word. Reason had come back. %SEX% had sexually assaulted %YOU%. If %YOU% wanted Oguri arrested, that would have been fair.
        -
        - The frenzy was gone. %SEX% couldn't even make an excuse for something that stupid. Both ears and the tail—the parts that show an %UMA%'s mood—hung low, regret and fear all over Oguri.
        -
        - acc: 1
          content: '「...Oguri.」'
        -
        - color: %COLOR%
          content:
            - fontWeight: bold
              content: Oguri Cap
            - 「Ah!」
        -
        - acc: 1
          content: 「Next time... be gentler.」
        -
        - color: %COLOR%
          content:
            - fontWeight: bold
              content: Oguri Cap
            - 「Huh...? Next time?」
    - acc: 2
      content: 「Get back.」（Not Yet）
      lines:
        - The look on that flushed face had already gone mad. Maybe it was fear—%YOU% jerked aside on instinct. It didn't help. The Monster still tried to force %YOU%'s mouth open. It didn't work.
        -
        - It hadn't worked, so %SEX% let go, panting, terror on that face.
        -
        - color: %COLOR%
          content:
            - fontWeight: bold
              content: Oguri Cap
            - 「What did I...」
        -
        - acc: 1
          content: 「Oguri... why would you do that?」
        -
        - color: %COLOR%
          content:
            - fontWeight: bold
              content: Oguri Cap
            - 「I... I don't know. I'm sorry... I'm sorry...」
        -
        - %YOU% and Oguri Cap stared at each other without a word. Reason had come back. %SEX% had sexually assaulted %YOU%. If %YOU% wanted Oguri arrested, that would have been fair.
        -
        - The frenzy was gone. %SEX% couldn't even make an excuse for something that stupid. Both ears and the tail—the parts that show an %UMA%'s mood—hung low, regret and fear all over Oguri.
        -
        - acc: 1
          content: '「...Oguri.」'
        -
        - color: %COLOR%
          content:
            - fontWeight: bold
              content: Oguri Cap
            - 「Ah!」
        -
        - acc: 1
          content: 「Training tomorrow, as usual.」
    -
    - %SEX% looked at %YOU% in shock, but %YOU% had already turned and walked off.

89:
  title: Together
  lines:
    - One night, Oguri Cap thought back to that forced kiss behind the school building.
    -
    - If Oguri hadn't found the nerve that day... this happiness probably wouldn't exist. There had been a chance %YOU% would hate it. For some reason, though, Oguri had this strange certainty that %YOURSEX% wouldn't.
    -
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: Oguri Cap
        - 「An awful, low %UMA% like me still found you in a sea of people. I'm so glad... %CALLNAME%.」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: Oguri Cap
        - 「So I won't let you go—」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: Oguri Cap
        - 「—not in this lifetime.」